OL,4,CKilmar Abrego Garcia arrives in Spain, 
OL,5,Cending Trump deportation battle        
OL,6,GKilmar Abrego Garcia, whose            
OL,7,Gdeportation last year to El Salvador   
OL,8,Gsparked a bitter legal battle, has     
OL,9,Garrived in Spain from the US.          
OL,11,FHe took a commercial flight to the     
OL,12,Fcountry on Tuesday. His lawyer said    
OL,13,Fthe relocation was temporary while     
OL,14,FAbrego Garcia sought to eventually     
OL,15,Freturn to the US.                      
